{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgR5fCosVTBHFoCjU5KnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Top three complaints from `reviews.csv`. There are 9 rows, and row 10 is a duplicate of row 3, so 8 unique reviews.\n\n1. **Price** is the biggest complaint, with 6 of 8 unique reviews. The rows are 2, 3, 4, 5, 8 and 9. Per-seat pricing and the price increase come up most.\n   > \"The price doubled this year.\" (Google Play, 2 stars)\n\n2. **Bugs and reliability** come up in 3 of 8 reviews (rows 6, 7 and 8). Reviewers mention crashes, double-bookings and wrong time zones.\n   > \"Booked twice for the same slot and the client was furious.\" (App Store, 1 star)\n\n3. **Missing features** come up in 2 of 8 reviews (rows 2 and 4). Reviewers ask for SMS reminders and buffer times between meetings.\n   > \"No way to set buffer times between meetings.\" (G2, 2 stars)\n\n- **Small sample:** 8 reviews is too few to call these trends on an investor call. I'd say \"in our sample\" or \"early signal\".\n- **Third place is close:** Unresponsive support has 1 review (row 3), so missing features only just beats it.\n- **Duplicate removed:** I dropped row 10 because it repeats row 3 with an extra space."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":583,"cache_read_input_tokens":42504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":583},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29d2b65c-654e-59e7-af4d-5e52c30e6871","uuid":"d24972a9-5403-4bcc-a83e-7bfe6df08005","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:25:21.029Z","request_id":"req_011CgR5fCVmdRTE6MfNuQCzk"}
